        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">For most people the best 2-in-1 folding treadmill is the UREVO Strol 2E</strong>:
            a 40-inch track, a 4 mph walking mode, a 6.2 mph running mode and a price around $170. The
            Goplus 2.25HP is the cheapest way in if you are happy walking slowly; the Strol 2E Pro adds
